<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela's Fogade to sell Seguros Banvalor Nov 7.</title>
<headline>Venezuela's Fogade to sell Seguros Banvalor Nov 7.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-10-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's Deposits Guarantee Fund (Fogade) announced Tuesday it would hold a November 7 auction to sell Seguros Banvalor, a state-controlled insurance concern, for a minimum price of 200 million bolivars ($425,000).</p>
<p>Fogade said in a release that it was selling the 98.80 percent of the company's stock it inherited when the government took over Banco Barinas in June 1994.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
